   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "57188d82-7706-4c28-ae6f-fee9ba82c13f"],
 " without a connection is the least angle over the list."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4f874118-9a6e-420f-a422-1bfcbd6d05c4"],

Cell["\<\
The Levi-Civita realisations are listed in full, with no cap. A long walk \
through vertices with many directions can give many of them.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"cda75c8e-9777-4990-969c-6f2ba41f0e41"],

Cell["Options of the Levi-Civita form:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"aebb81a7-e65e-43f9-be75-71a705a7c7c9"],

